</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">Should brands stop creating informational content due to AI Overview competition?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">No, informational content remains valuable for establishing topical authority and supporting decision-stage content. The key is optimizing informational resources for AI consumption while expanding into content categories that drive engagement and conversions.</p>
</div>
</section>

